flowchart LR
    A[Documents] --> B[Chunk]
    B --> C[Embedding model]
    C --> D[Vectors + metadata]
    D --> E[Build index: HNSW / IVF / PQ]
    E --> F[(Vector store)]
    G[Query text] --> H[Embed query]
    H --> I[ANN search: top-k by cosine/dot]
    F --> I
    I --> J[Metadata filter]
    J --> K[Ranked neighbors]
    K --> L[Use in RAG / search / dedup]
